    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title is a physics-based 3D sword fighting game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They fight against warriors with flexible bodies to become champions of the arena.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players: 1-8</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game distribution/monetization: OK</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Dalafri?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warriors who use their flexible bodies to fight are called \u201cdalafri.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dalafri controls his body, which is shaken by movement and other factors, to attack and guard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fighting in the arena</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the arena, the survivor is the winner. Use a variety of weapons such as swords, shields, spears, and dumbbells to win.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapon Combinations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The right hand and left hand can be equipped with different weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can fight freely by changing the combination, such as equipping a sword and shield to balance offense and defense, or equipping both hands with spears to keep the enemy at bay.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title is a physics-based 3D sword fighting game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They fight against warriors with flexible bodies to become champions of the arena.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players: 1-8</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game distribution/monetization: OK</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Dalafri?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warriors who use their flexible bodies to fight are called \u201cdalafri.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dalafri controls his body, which is shaken by movement and other factors, to attack and guard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fighting in the arena</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the arena, the survivor is the winner. Use a variety of weapons such as swords, shields, spears, and dumbbells to win.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapon Combinations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The right hand and left hand can be equipped with different weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can fight freely by changing the combination, such as equipping a sword and shield to balance offense and defense, or equipping both hands with spears to keep the enemy at bay.</p>",
    "short_description": "This title is a physics-based 3D sword fighting game. They fight against warriors with flexible bodies to become champions of the arena.",
